msgid "Audit Logging"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| maintains a comprehensive audit trail of all administrative "
"and operational actions performed through the UI and API. Audit logs use "
"the industry-standard **Common Event Format (CEF)** and support export to"
" SIEM platforms for compliance and security monitoring."
msgstr ""

